              "text": "حومه (hume) — \"the outskirts, the suburbs\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خانواده ما در حومه شهر زندگی میکند. Khânevâde-ye mâ dar hume-ye shahr zendegi mikonad. Our family lives on the outskirts of the town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Usually hume-ye shahr."
            }
          ]
        },
