              "text": "برج (borj) — \"a tower; a tower block\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "از بالای برج تمام شهر را دیدیم. Az bâlâ-ye borj tamâm-e shahr râ didim. From the top of the tower we saw the whole town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Arabic plural boruj. Also a sign of the zodiac."
            }
          ]
        },
