            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وسط میدان یک مجسمه بزرگ است. Vasat-e meydân yek mojassame-ye bozorg ast. There is a big statue in the middle of the square."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on jesm 'body': a thing given a body."
